WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:06.230
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:16.410
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.010
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.550
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.550
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.960
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.520
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:35.130
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.830
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.600
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.270
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.980
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.240
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:55.620
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:59.380
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.520
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:06.460
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:09.260
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:11.500
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:15.800
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:22.330
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:37.380
Hey, hey! Yams!

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:42.860
Stone-baked yams!

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:45.220
Piping hot!

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:49.830
Stone-baked yams!

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:52.270
Mister!

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:54.300
I wish he would wait!

00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:01.230
Stone-baked yams!

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:03.280
Mister!

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:07.440
<i>No, no, young lady.</i>

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:13.390
That baked yam seller is mean.
He won't stop if you call him Mister.

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:17.930
I see. I understand now!

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:24.660
Hey, young man!! You, the young
man selling baked yamsl!

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:32.570
Who are you calling young?
I won't fall for such obvious flattery!

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:37.070
Never mind that. I want
you to sell me this much.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:40.410
What?! Don't tell me
you're eating all that?!

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:44.480
You'll be farting so much,
no man will dare come near you!

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:48.920
It- It's not for me! I was asked to
get them for everyone in the dormitory!

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:53.690
Can't young girls buy their
own baked yams nowadays?!

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:58.490
Nobody would buy these ugly buggers
if it wasn't for the good smell!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.070
Is there something on my face?!

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.270
No, it's nothing!

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:10.540
Here! Paying me with your
rattling change! It's a nuisance!

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:21.350
Hey. hey!

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:26.890
<i>Steam baked yams!</i>

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:29.360
Baked yams!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:42.340
SU Ml RE DORM RULES:
#1: Be pure and honest
#2: Help one another
#3: Be very beautiful
#4: Be healthy in body and soul

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.310
Yes!
All ready!

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:47.640
I've never had baked yams before!

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.340
<i>Good work, Fei!</i>

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:54.220
Good grief. The yam seller
thought these were all for me.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.780
We're sorry!
But it's too embarrassing to buy them!

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:59.850
That's okay, but...

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:01.490
What's wrong?

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:05.160
<i>For some reason, that old man
reminded me of home...</i>

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:15.710
NEW YORK
United Nations Headquarters

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.350
Are you Japanese?

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:24.410
No, I am a universal citizen.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.080
Yes, sir, AEGIS!

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:31.020
All-purpose translator set complete!

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:33.890
The commanders from every
branch are already assembled.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:39.400
Very well, let's begin the invader
counter measures strategy assembly.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:46.470
Hey, hey! Baked yams!

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.440
Young man!

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:52.280
What?! Oh, it's you again.
You show up every day recently.

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.410
Ayaya! Do you have a cold?

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.350
This is nothing for the likes of me!

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.590
For Pete's sake... here!

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:10.760
Well, see you tomorrow!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:14.890
Heh! I don't give two
rat poops about tomorrow.

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.680
Now to go home and eat...

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:26.580
Idiot! Be careful!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.810
Mister!

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:34.450
Mister...

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.450
My stomach is grumbling
and it won't stop!

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:43.930
So, where is the seller of the
yummy yams you told me about?

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:47.770
Hmm... That's strange...

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.970
It's usually easy to find
him at this time ofday...

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:56.510
Fei goes to buy yams
from him every day now.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.510
Oh, are you looking
for the yam man?

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:01.450
<i>Yes, ma'am!</i>

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:05.450
just a moment ago, I heard
a loud, startling screech...

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:11.430
...when I went to look, I saw the
yam man nearly hit by a car.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:15.120
Then what happened?
ls he all right?

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:18.790
Now that I think about it,
a girl with bunned hair...

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:23.460
...young enough to be in
elementary school was helping him home.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:27.200
A girl with bunned hair?

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.510
Young enough to be
in elementary school?

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.250
Mister! I went shopping!

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:43.620
I'll make you porridge right away!

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:48.190
First you invade my home,
and now you're making porridge?!

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:52.470
Shouting will not help your cold!

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:56.630
Still, you really scared me.
I thought you had been hit by a car.

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:02.340
It will be ready soon.

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.640
For an old man, you're a big baby.

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:21.090
Those are strays
roaming around this area.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:24.330
I gave them food, and before I
knew it, they started coming here.

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:30.570
This tastes horrible!

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:35.710
The paste cake I ate during
the war was better than this!

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:39.950
You all get along with
each other, don't you?

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.550
You're noisy.

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:56.360
That one's named Spitz. He looks
cute, so he's a popular dog recently.

00:07:56.770 --> 00:08:00.130
Mr. Spitz, huh?
You sure are nice though.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:03.870
Not everyone would look
after so many dogs and cats.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:08.370
Are you nuts?!
I never asked them to come here!

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:10.480
Hey, get out of here!

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:14.780
Hey! That's not very nice, mister!

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:16.680
I don't care!

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:29.200
Well, mister, see
you again tomorrow.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:32.430
Are you going to come
feed me more garbage?!

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:36.660
If you don't like it,
then get better soon.

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:46.680
This is a report of the present
conditions of invader outbreaks...

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:50.340
...in the main advanced
countries for the year 1969.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:55.580
Invader outbreaks are increasing
drastically in the Far East...

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.820
...especially in Japan. It has
three times the occurrences...

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:01.390
...as West Germany,
which is second place.

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:06.130
I want the opinion of the Far Eastern
branch commander on this matter.

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:11.430
The only thing I can say with
any certainty is that invaders...

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:15.970
...are replacing humans in actual
existence more cleverly than before...

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:20.880
...secretly but steadily
continuing to build their numbers.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.530
Hey, little girl.

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:45.730
Yes?

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:48.940
Are you related to
the man living here?

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:53.440
H- Huh? Um,well, it
is something like that.

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:58.680
Then will you complain to him for me?
He's been making strange voices...

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:02.450
...in the middle of the night. Maybe
he's having nightmares. Good grief.

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:03.860
Strange voices?

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:07.020
I'm counting on you.
I don't say it myself...

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:10.900
...but everyone around here
thinks he's a weird fellow.

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:12.800
Take care of it, will you?

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.430
It can't be!

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:19.310
Mister?

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:35.010
Where is the man
inside the coat?

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:40.890
Sunglasses?!

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:44.730
EARTH DEFENSE HANDBOOK

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:48.740
Um... This information is unconfirmed,
however, invaders carry sunglasses...

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:53.300
...made from special materials, used
when manifesting their true nature.

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:55.940
It- It can't be!!

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:07.980
<i>No! You can? do that!</i>

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:10.790
<i>I know! It! get rid of these!</i>

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:13.260
...stupid glasses!!

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:16.390
What are you doing?

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:19.490
Mister...

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:29.410
Paranormal frequencies registered!

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:32.240
Point N-505, E-205!

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:34.350
The center of the residential district!

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.680
Oh, no!

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:42.420
What is it this time?

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:46.790
Everyone, invaders have appeared
in the residential district!

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:51.860
Wait a minute! This is the area the yam
seller Fei is nursing to health lives!

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:52.900
It can't be!

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:56.230
Fei is in danger!

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:58.840
All right, we'll head out immediately!!

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:02.810
But the commander is away on business!
We can't head out without orders!

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:05.610
No, you're wrong!
A new invader tragedy...

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:09.120
...may very well be unfolding
at this very moment!

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:13.110
As the secretary of the Far
Eastern AEGIS branch commander...

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:17.790
...l order you to proceed immediately to the
point of paranormal frequency broadcast!

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:21.490
...to ascertain its identity,
and if necessary, to destroy it!!

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:24.430
Head out, Gate Keepers!

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.730
Roger, AEGIS!

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:28.900
Just hurry!

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:32.000
What do you mean,
get out?! This is my...

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:37.240
Trust me! lfyou don't hurry,
everybody will take you away!

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:39.310
Taken away? Where?

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:41.580
I don't want to see
it happen again!!!

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:46.580
In the village I was born,
my grandfather was taken away!

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:50.920
He was only making folk crafts, but they
said it was the work for the country...

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:53.050
...so they took him away
against his will.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:59.290
I see... You're from
China, aren't you?

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:08.700
You look like my grandfather!
So please... So please!

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:12.310
I don't want my grandpa
to be taken away again!!

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.130
Is this the place?

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:29.100
Oh, my! It's really rundown!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.090
That's the yam seller's
cart over there!

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:34.140
<i>STONE-BAKED YAMS</i>

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:36.630
Where is Fei?!
Over here!

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:43.810
Fei, where's the invader?

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:48.920
Grandpa... run!!

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:50.880
An invader?!

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.580
I don't know what's going on,
but I'll do as you say!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.120
Uh... hey!!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:00.530
GATE OPEN!

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.700
I'm sorry, Captain...

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:13.070
Fei! We only came to find the
cause of the paranormal frequency!

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:16.070
Don't move! That's a lie!

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:18.580
Grandfather is an invader,
but he is a good person!

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:21.080
So I will not let
you take him away!

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:24.140
With my Gate of Fire,
I can keep him safe!

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:28.090
I'll do what I could not do beforel!

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:29.950
<i>Stop it Fei!</i>

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:31.360
Why are you gonna
attack the Captain?!

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.920
That's too dangerous!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.990
This has evolved
into a nightmare!

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:40.500
Fighting amongst themselves...
Disgraceful.

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:44.430
All right, Fei.

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.310
I'll believe what
you're saying. However...

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:52.350
...we still need to find the source
of the paranormal frequency.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.810
But... That's...

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:58.220
Please. Fei, lf he is a
non-threatening invader...

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.250
...l don't want to hurt him, either.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:03.850
Please?

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:07.950
Grandpa!

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:15.030
What happened, Grandpa?!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.500
It's Spitz...!

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:19.230
What?!

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:49.090
This is horrible!

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:52.200
The stray dog...
...turned into a monstefl!

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:54.140
Don't tell me it's an invader dog!

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:56.610
Then it's the source of
the paranormal frequency?!

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:00.700
Kill... Hate... Destroy!

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.800
A monster! A monster!

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:19.100
GATE OPEN!!

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:21.090
Vacuous Missile!

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:22.970
Arrow of Light!!

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:27.710
It's no good!
Our weapons are ineffective!

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:42.890
We have to do something
about him, quick!

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:46.190
What? Captain Ukiya..!

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:47.790
Megane!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:51.130
Ms. Ochiai instructed me
to bring you the gate robot!

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.790
Nice timing!

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:57.500
It's ready to go!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:00.840
OPEN THE GATE!

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:03.540
<i>Launch</i>

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:13.980
Let's go!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:22.420
Supi-Gon!! That is Supi-Gon,
the legendary monstefl!

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:23.970
Ukiya!

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:44.580
It's no good. I have to
get close to him somehow!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:03.800
It's the Supi-Gon!!!
We have to back up Ukiya!

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:13.880
Steel Wall!!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.840
Thank you, Kurogane!

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:21.980
Rats. I extended my barrier too far.

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:25.890
Forget that, help Ukiya!
Oh, yeah!

00:18:31.570 --> 00:18:33.360
Stop!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:36.530
I won't allow you
to destroy my shop!!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.500
Grandpa!

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:42.010
Don't, Grandpa!

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:45.840
Everyone?! I guess you
did take good care of them.

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:50.240
<i>You'll get hit, Fei!
Get everyone out of here, quick!</i>

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:52.290
I know that, Captain!

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:57.550
Fei!

00:18:57.630 --> 00:18:59.220
Run!

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.860
GATE OPEN!!

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:08.390
Shocking Dragon Bullet!!

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:13.070
I will not let you kill my friends!!

00:19:15.310 --> 00:19:16.900
NOW!

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.640
<i>I'm up here!</i>

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:27.950
Ultra Vacuous Chopl!

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.870
You were as impressive
as always, Ukiya!

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:44.560
Nah, it's all due
to my maintenance!

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:48.540
No, you're both wrong.

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:50.600
Huh?

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:53.510
That's true.
This time, the glory goes to Fei.

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:04.290
What do you mean by that?

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:08.590
Unfortunately, no branch
has surplus arms.

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:12.330
In regard to incidents occurring within
the jurisdiction of the Far Eastern branch...

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:16.360
...we want all to be dealt with
by the Far Eastern branch, unaided.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.630
But, sir...!

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:22.640
At present, there are twenty-one formally
authorized gate keepers in the entire world.

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:26.270
Of those, fifteen are
participating with AEGIS.

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:29.540
Six are assigned to
the Far Eastern branch.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:34.850
I personally think that is too
many for the Orient island country.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:38.090
What more can you possibly want?

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:43.360
This is the consensus
of all country branches.

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:46.370
We have verified the
elimination of the two executives.

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:50.460
We want the Far Eastern branch
to use its existing arms...

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:54.130
...to confront situations
that may arise. That is all!

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:04.450
Dear, dear... Huh?

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:09.650
You won't get anything for helping out.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.390
Those glasses look good on you.

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:13.020
What?

00:21:13.090 --> 00:21:19.120
When I had a family, I worked in a
coal mine. I'm not used to the sun.

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:23.370
The girl in this picture looks like me.

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:25.930
Eh? No, she doesn't!

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:29.500
Besides, she's over 4O years old now!
Who knows if she's dead or alive?!

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:32.210
She never comes to show me
the faces of my grandchildren!

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:35.070
Grandpa...

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:38.310
Shut up! I'm only 67!!

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:47.790
Get your godawful tasting,
crummy stone-baked yams here!!

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:53.230
Get your actually very
delicious stone-baked yams!

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:57.540
Fleecy clouds high in the sky
billow with the aroma of yams,
Stone-baked yarns!

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:10.620
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:10.620 --> 00:22:14.490
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:14.590 --> 00:22:19.460
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:22.830
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:24.970
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:24.970 --> 00:22:30.140
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:33.480
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:33.480 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:38.810 --> 00:22:42.980
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:43.050 --> 00:22:47.610
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:54.390
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
